n class="ff1">程序中断方式</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x14 h10 y3e0 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.2.1<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff1">单级中断</span></div><div class="t m0 x2e h7 y3e1 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">在单级中断系统中，所有的中断源都属于同一级，<span class="_ _3"></span>所有中断源触发器排成一行，其优先次序是离<span class="_ _15"> </span><span class="ff3">CPU<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>近的</div><div class="t m0 x4 h7 y3e2 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">优先权高。</div><div class="t m0 x14 h10 y3e3 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">8.2.2<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff1">多级中断</span></div><div class="t m0 x2e h7 y3e4 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">级中断系统是指计算机系统中有相当多的中断源，<span class="_ _26"></span>根据各中断事件的轻重缓急程度不同而分成若干级别，<span class="_ _79"></span>每</div><div class="t m0 x4 h7 y3e5 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">一中断级<span class="_ _12"></span>分配给一个<span class="_ _12"></span>优先权。一般<span class="_ _12"></span>说来，优先权<span class="_ _12"></span>高的中断级<span class="_ _12"></span>可以打断优先<span class="_ _12"></span>权低的中断<span class="_ _12"></span>服务程序，以<span class="_ _12"></span>程序嵌套方</div><div class="t m0 x4 h7 y3e6 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">式进行工作。</div><div class="t m0 x4 hd y5d ff9 fs2 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5c"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">32<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _5c"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
